    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Amid misfortune striking the core with their injury-depleted roster, the franchise facing adversity confronted a coaching change just as the playoff series reached its critical juncture. The coach hired under pressure then guided a successful interim management, leading the team through the sports event. However, the defensive performance in the final game, a strategic game execution by the NHL team from Vegas, culminated in a playoff series win, ending the harmed party's journey in a sweep completion on May 26.",
